      "statusChangeNewStatus": "open",
      "value": "Let's swap this back to Open. That doesn't mean anything other than \"leaving stuff as under review for almost a year seems annoying\". It makes people think that we're working on it *right now* and it is on the way out soon. It isn't.\n...but **we're still considering this and it is still a good idea.** I just want Custom Statuses from Canny, thank you very much! 😡 Would love to set things as \"Under Consideration\" or \"Tracked Internally\". \nAnyways, well aware that this could be useful. Personally, I'm worried about attaching *even more* functionality to the friend state of a user. I might be wrong on that? Just a thought.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
